# Everything text in this repository is LF, checked out LF on every platform.
#
# This is not a style preference: containers/*.sh and containers/awg-* are
# copied into an Alpine image and executed there. A CRLF line ending on the
# shebang makes the kernel look for an interpreter named "/bin/sh\r", and the
# container dies with a "no such file or directory" that names a file which
# plainly exists. Editing one of these on Windows without this file is enough
# to cause it.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz  binary
